{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43073","headline":"夏日闺怨 · 蔡瓌","name":"夏日闺怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桃径李蹊绝芳园，炎氛炽日满愁轩。\n枝上鸟惊朱槿落，池中鱼戏绿苹翻。\n君恋京师久留滞，妾怨高楼积年岁。\n非关曾入楚王宫，直爲相思腰转细。\n卧簟乘闲乍逐凉，熏炉畏热嬾焚香。\n雨沾柳叶如啼眼，露滴莲花似汗妆。\n全由独自羞看影，艳是孤眠疑夜永。\n无情拂镜不成妆，有时却扇还风静。\n近日书来道欲归，鸳鸯文锦字息机。\n但恐愁容不相识，爲教恒着别时衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蔡瓌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43073.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43073","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}